{
  "slug": "memoriant-perf-test-skill",
  "name": "Memoriant Perf Test Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Load test plan generator for Claude Code. Creates steady-state, burst, and soak test configurations from service profiles and SLOs. Generates test scripts for k6, Locust, or Artillery with metrics interpretation guides and evidence logging.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `perf-test` (Generate load test plans from service profiles) and **1 agent**, `perf-test-planner`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-perf-test-skill@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-perf-test-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that generates complete load test plans from service profiles. Describe your service's traffic shape and SLOs — get back steady-state, burst, and soak test configurations with stage durations, SLO-aligned checks, and metrics to watch. Interprets results from previous runs and appends tamper-evident evidence records.",
